( -- )  100  sym? if  10 *  then                  0 do  sync sendbyte  loop  [char] *  sendbyte ;                                                                               \ Send EOT string                                               : SENDPOSTAMBLE  ( -- )                                           eot sendbyte  eot sendbyte ;                                  \ SETENDADDR                                                    \ Set end address according to input filesize                   : SETENDADDR  ( -- )                                              infid @ fsize  ( get input file size )                          saddr @ 0 d+   ( add startaddr )                                2dup $10001. du< not  if ( too high )                             cr ." End address exceeds $FFFF"  error2                      then                                                            drop  eaddr ! ;                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                               \ ENCODE                                                        \ Convert program file to wave                                  : ENCODE  ( -- )                                                  setendaddr                                                      startwave                                                       sendpreamble                                                    sendid                                                          0 checksum !                                                    sendaddress                                                     senddata                      