                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                \ SAMPLE SEEK+ SEEK- SEEKHALF                                   \ Get sample                                                    : SAMPLE  ( -- char )                                             readchar 0= 1 ?throw  1 samplecount +! ;                                                                                      \ Seek +ve going edge                                           : SEEK+  ( -- )  begin  sample  silencemax >  until ;                                                                           \ Seek -ve going edge                                           : SEEK-  ( -- )  begin  sample  silencemin <  until ;                                                                           \ Seek half cycle                                               : SEEKHALF  ( -- samples )                                        samplecount off                                                 polarity @ if  seek+  else  seek-  then  samplecount @          flip-polarity ;                                               \ SEEKWHOLE GETTONE GETTONE-KIM GETTONE-SYM                     \ Seek whole cycle                                              : SEEKWHOLE  ( -- samples )                                       seekhalf seekhalf + ;                                                                                                         \ Get basic element  true = high tone                           defer GETTONE  ( -- flag )                                                                                                      \ For KIM get whole cycle  true = high tone                     : GETTONE-KIM  ( -- flag )                                        seekwhole  maxwave > not ;                                                                                                    \ For SYM get half cycle  true = high tone                      : GETTONE-SYM  ( -- flag )                                        seekhalf  3 - maxwave > not ;                                                                                                 \ GETBIT-KIM                                                    \ Get next bit                                                  : GETBIT-KIM  ( -- bit )                                          0 begin                                                           lastcycle @  dup >r  +  ( sum weights )                         3  ( new weight )                                               gettone if  ( high tone )                                         negate                                                          seekhalf drop  ( discard next half cycle )                    then                                                            dup lastcycle !                                                 r> <  ( compare last with new )                               until   ( start of new bit )                                    0> abs ;                                                                                                                                                                                      \ GETBIT-SYM                                                    \ Get next bit                                                  : GETBIT-SYM  ( -- bit )                                          0                                                               gettone if  ( high tone )                                         1+                                                              seekhalf drop  ( discard next halfcycle )                     then ;                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                        \ GETBIT ?EMIT DECODEBYTE -DECODEBYTE                           \ Get next bit                                                  defer  GETBIT  ( -- bit )                                                                                                       \ Write char to console                                         : ?EMIT ( char -- )  conout @ if  emit  else  drop  then ;                                                                      \ Decode next byte                                              : DECODEBYTE  ( -- byt )                                          sym? if  seekhalf drop  then  ( discard start bit )             0  databits 0 do  1 rshift  getbit  7 lshift  or  loop          dup ?emit ;                                                                                                                   \ Decode next byte ignoring EOF                                 : -DECODEBYTE  ( -- byt )                                         ['] decodebyte 1 ?catch if  256 ( dummy )  then ;             \ SYNCHRONIZE FINDSYNC                                          \ Scan bitstream for sync character                             : SYNCHRONIZE  ( -- )                                             0 begin                                                           1 rshift  getbit  7 lshift  or  dup sync =                    until  ?emit ;                                                                                