2@ drop  saddr @ +  eaddr @ = if                      decodebyte  dup [char] /  <> if  s" /" missing  then            false  exit  then                                             decodebyte                                                    else                                                              decodebyte                                                      dup [char] /  = if  false  exit  then                           0 swap hexchar  decodebyte hexchar  ( form byte )             then                                                            true ;                                                                                                                                                                                        \ GETDATA SKIPHEADER                                            \ Get program data                                              : GETDATA  ( -- )                                                 0. decodecount 2!                                               begin                                                             getdatabyte                                                   while ( not end )                                                 +checksum                                                       conout @ if  drop  else  writechar  then                        1 decodecount m+!                                             repeat drop ;                                                                                                                 \ Skip WAV/VOC header                                           : SKIPHEADER  ( -- )                                              64 0 do  readchar if  drop  else  leave  then  loop ;                                                                         \ DECODE                                                        \ Convert wave file to program                                  : DECODE  ( -- )                                                  skipheader                    