                  setmode                                                         r/o openinfile                                                  decoding @ if                                                     conout @ 0= if  r/w openoutfile  then                           cr decode                                                     else                                                              r/w openoutfile                                                 cr encode                                                     then                                                            closefiles                                                      ;                                                                                                                                                                                             \ DEFAULTS                                                      \ Set defaults                                                  : DEFAULTS  ( -- )                                                mode off  decoding on  conout off  1 speed !  5 leadtime !      wave off  sine off  polarity off  fileid off  $200 saddr ! ;                                                                  defaults                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                        \ RUN PROGRAM                                                   \ Run application with error handling                           : RUN  ( -- )                                                     ['] (run) catch ?dup if ( err# ) errfix  throw  then ;                                                                        \ Main                                                          : PROGRAM  ( -- )                                                 set-io                \ set console method                      cr title              \ show program name                       defaults              \ set defaults                            parsecmd              \ get options/filenames                   run                   \ run application                         cr ." done"           \ show success                            ;                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                             